4. TEST DETAILS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

test_preset_accurate_more_faces:
  Fixture: 2 triangles at ~0.17 deg dihedral (h=0.0299, L=100, perp=10)
  Balanced: centroid dist 0.009967 < 0.01 -> offset passes; angle 0.17 < 0.5 -> merges (1 face)
  Accurate: centroid dist 0.009967 > 0.0001 -> offset fails -> splits (2 faces)
  Result: accurate (2) > balanced (1)

test_preset_coarse_fewer_faces:
  Fixture: 2 triangles at ~0.69 deg dihedral (h=0.122, L=100, perp=10)
  Balanced: angle 0.69 > 0.5 -> splits (2 faces)
  Coarse: centroid dist 0.0407 < 0.1 -> offset passes; angle 0.69 < 1.0 -> merges (1 face)
  Result: coarse (1) < balanced (2)

test_individual_override:
  Single coplanar face; v4+v5 at gap 0.02 cm
  Default snap_tol ~0.005: not merged -> higher vertex_count
  snap_tol=0.5: merged -> lower vertex_count

test_preset_and_individual_override:
  preset="accurate" + snap_tol=0.5 -> individual wins, vertices merge

test_invalid_preset_raises:
  preset="ultra" -> returned error dict with "unknown preset" message
  (decompose_mesh_faces catches ValueError and returns error dict)

test_default_no_params_unchanged:
  decompose_mesh_faces(nodes, indices) == decompose_mesh_faces(nodes, indices, ...all defaults)
  Proven byte-identical via json.dumps comparison.

